{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06560","headline":"同王十三维偶然作十首 七 · 储光羲","name":"同王十三维偶然作十首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日暮登春山，山鲜云复轻。\n远近看春色，踟蹰新月明。\n仙人浮丘公，对月时吹笙。\n丹鸟飞熠熠，苍蝇乱营营。\n羣动汩吾真，讹言伤我情。\n安得如子晋，与之游太清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}